  "limits": [
    "All measurements use userspace CLOCK_MONOTONIC, not physical UART edges or motor sample/application timestamps.",
    "The finite test uses absolute releases and skips expired slots; it is not the ROS controller_manager scheduler.",
    "Control workload uses synthetic standing joints, real estimator/NMPC/WBC code and always discards numerical motor commands.",
    "Policy age follows production backend reception semantics, not independently measured sensor-to-solve age.",
    "Shadow write-to-send matches host ordering only; identical zero packets have no firmware command sequence echo.",
    "P99.9 is an empirical finite-sample quantile, not a worst-case or long-term real-time guarantee.",
    "read_start/end describe userspace retrieval; UART, USB and driver buffering before retrieval remain unmeasured.",
    "Device timestamps and host monotonic timestamps are unsynchronized; relative phase removes only the initial offset.",
    "No absolute sensor latency or internal filter delay can be inferred.",
    "Consumer executes the production estimator/NMPC/WBC algorithms in an isolated harness, with synthetic standing joints.",
    "The consumer is not the production ROS controller callback/executor; shared-memory locking/dispatch overhead is included.",
    "IMU and AHRS records retain separate device/retrieval times; latest gyro and orientation need not be acquired simultaneously.",
    "测试只覆盖站姿数值负载，没有Trot或生产ROS执行器/消息队列的完整时序。",
    "执行频率由本探针的绝对时隙和跳过策略产生，不能当作生产控制器实际频率或电机最高通信频率。",
    "未测量设备内部采样/滤波/电机应用时刻，不能把SDK往返或shadow等待直接作为仿真额外5ms延迟的替代值。"
